  m_text: "It's almost time for your EXAM! better hurry and RUSH to school.\n\n(Level
    1) \nBefore going to school collect items so you can leave the house.\n\nItems
    to Collect:\n- Exam Permit\n- Uniform\n- ID\n\n(Level 2)\nYou have reach STI
    Bacoor School be sure you are prepared for the exam.\n\nItems to Collect:\n-
    Ballpen \n- Reviewer\n- Exam Paper\n\nNote: Avoid obstacles to make sure you
    stay proper and clean for school. Hurry its almost TIME.\n\nObjectives:\n- Collect
    Items to complete the level. (2 items Passing)\n- Avoid obstacles. (getting hit
    will increase \"Retry\" count)\n- Repeat levels and make your personal best and
    FASTEST score.\n"
